        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.13+NUM.14.14+NUM.14.15+NUM.14.16+NUM.14.17+NUM.14.18+NUM.14.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 14:13-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsagh Musa ECHOTYON Tororötïnyi akïlö, “We ECHOTYON, ompö ne tenarekanyi ompö piköku cho kimïtunenyi koro Misri ompö owesyengu nyo wow? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imökenyi tökïmwa pipö Misri lö, ‘Kimïtuna chane koro Misri atökwighchï ghöyityö, kïpar chane ompö kutïngkot akuwany ompö ngwïny?’ Waghakena ompö nörekyengu aipïstö ghöyityonï imöchenyi ighchine piköku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.22.16+GEN.22.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tow 22:16-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nana mötworiku ompö Apraam nko Isak nko Yakopo cho kiwolwolchinyi chane lö, ‘Otösan yiyenkwa kïchangit le kokelya yïm akï otönan koronini kïmïkul koyomiswokwa yiyenkwa akïmïlöy chane kokay.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpïstö nyu ECHOTYON ghöyityö nyo kimököy kwighchini chane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
