          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kirich Musa möngot akïsïwa moghay nko tumöt, kïnarek tya akïwirchï ngwïny koghichay töpölöl kömi morichi kïghyösyö ompö kutïng to. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïcheng moghay kigh chane akïpel akïnga ntökïlïkwï pïsya akïtankwara pögh akuchikyï pipö Israel kïgha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Musa Aron, “Keghunyi ne pïchï tepchinönyi ngokï cho echön lechï?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Aron, “Menörekyante werïnyo, ompöwölo inkïtönyi lö ipchini kegh kïnomnyö pïchï ghöyityö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenchanïn chane, ‘Ighwecha tororöt nyo ntöghoghwecha, ompöwölo melö kinkïtöcha lö ne nyo kegha ompö Musa nyay kimïtunenecha koro Misri.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olenchan chane, ‘Nya kïngwïsï chi anka tïkwïl kari koltin cho tïng.’ Kïlenyona kïkonanïn chane karikwa, owirchan ma kungwïn moghï.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kisïwa Musa lö, kipïsyï Aron pich kïtironchö atökïnyorï arasï ompö kwenu pungkökwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kughyongö kuka möngot akïtep lö, “Ngo nyo mi okumpö ECHOTYON? Nyonö wölo omitan.” Kïghamït kegh pipö Lawi akïpa wölo mi nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï chane, “Kölö ECHOTYON Tororöt pö Israel, ‘Chenga chi anka tïkwïl chokengu aiwö woptin löwïr ompö kukot löwïr cho pö möngot aipar chi anka tïkwïl werïngwo nko kongengu nko pöröryengu.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh pipö Lawi kïrïp kegh nko ngala Musa, kïmeghö pich asisoni cho ngata 3,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Musa, “Kotïlilökwa kegh asete ompö ighisyo ECHOTYON, ompöwölo melö karïp chi ompö akwa werïnyi anta werïngwa, atökïkonokwa ECHOTYON perur asete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Musa pich ato le asïyech, “Kaghakwa ngokï cho echön, owetan ye wölo mi ECHOTYON, töptoy oghan kinyoryogh ompö ngokikwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmïla Musa wölo mi ECHOTYON akïlö, “We ECHOTYON kegh pïchï ngokï cho echön, keghchï kegh tororöt pö koltin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.69.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tum 69:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ngo 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ye nyu, löstoghchinö ngokikwa anta mölenyona, ingongoghtanïn ompö kitapungu nyay kikirchinyi piköku.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Chi anka tïkwïl nyo kighwanïn ngokï nyo ongongoghtenan ompö kitapunyan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wïyö ye nyu, ntöghoghchinö pich kïpa walay komwowunyi, wetöy malaykayantenyan tawungu. Wölo otöninan chane sitöt ato lekït ompö ngokikwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtorchï ECHOTYON pïchay sömew, ompöwölo kichikyï chane Aron kwigh mogh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kömwochï ECHOTYON pipö Israel kïwuwö kutïng pö Sinay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
